    "退出 DJI 账号": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sign Out of DJI"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "退出后，真机飞行能力可能受 DJI 激活与地区规则限制；你可以随时重新登录。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After signing out, real-aircraft features may be limited by DJI activation and regional rules. You can sign in again at any time."
          }
        }
      }
    },
