    "Mock 登录回调成功（非真实 DJI 登录）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mock sign-in callback succeeded (not a real DJI sign-in)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "当前为模拟器 Mock：按钮只验证应用回调和状态刷新，不会连接 DJI 账号服务。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Simulator Mock is active. This button only verifies callbacks and state refresh; it does not connect to DJI account services."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "登录页面已结束，但 DJI SDK 尚未确认账号已登录，请重试或检查网络。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The sign-in page closed, but DJI SDK has not confirmed the account. Retry or check the network."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "暂不登录": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not Now"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "DJI 登录已过期。重新登录后可恢复需要账号激活的真机飞行能力。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your DJI sign-in has expired. Sign in again to restore real-aircraft features that require account activation."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "登录后可使用需要 DJI 账号激活的真机飞行能力；也可以暂不登录，仅使用预览和仿真功能。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sign in to use real-aircraft features that require DJI account activation, or continue without signing in for preview and simulation."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "登录由 DJI MSDK 安全页面完成；OpenFly 不读取或保存账号密码。未登录仍可使用预览和仿真，真机飞行能力可能受 DJI 激活与地区规则限制。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sign-in is completed on DJI MSDK's secure page. OpenFly does not read or store account passwords. Preview and simulation remain available without sign-in; real-aircraft features may be limited by DJI activation and regional rules."
          }
        }
      }
    },
