    "关闭（WGS‑84）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Off (WGS‑84)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "默认自动：任务、飞控、日志和导出始终使用 WGS‑84；仅中国大陆地图显示采用 GCJ‑02。若当前 Apple 地图底图已自行校准，可在此关闭，国外坐标不受影响。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Automatic by default: missions, flight control, logs, and exports always use WGS‑84; only map display in mainland China uses GCJ‑02. Turn this off if the current Apple map is already calibrated. Coordinates outside China are unaffected."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "任务 WGS‑84 · 中国地图已校准": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
