      }
    },
    "X/Y 单步平面距离不超过 10m；Z 范围 ±0.5m，下降保留 0.8m 安全高度。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each X/Y step is limited to 10 m; Z is limited to ±0.5 m, with a 0.8 m safety height when descending."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "与飞行高度实时联动": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Linked to flight altitude in real time"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "主动补缺分组（修改后需重新安全预检）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Active recapture groups (rerun safety check after changes)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "云端仅接受固定 Azure HTTPS 主机；本地 ZIP 与云端包都会核对 manifest、目录大小、SHA-256 和每个模型文件，再原子安装。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cloud downloads accept only the fixed Azure HTTPS host. Local ZIP and cloud packages are validated by manifest, directory size, SHA-256, and every model file before atomic installation."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仅在 Simulator 关闭且飞机未起飞时可修改；下次启动生效。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Can be changed only while Simulator is off and the aircraft is grounded; takes effect on the next start."
          }
        }
      }
    },
