    "手动起飞（默认）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Manual takeoff (default)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "打开相册会让 DJI 相机暂时进入回放/媒体下载模式；关闭后自动恢复拍照和图传。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Opening the gallery temporarily switches the DJI camera to playback/media-download mode. Capture and live video resume automatically after closing it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "执行环境自动选择：DJI Simulator 激活时走仿真；否则仅允许真机手动起飞、稳定悬停后执行。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The execution environment is selected automatically: DJI Simulator when active; otherwise real-aircraft execution requires manual takeoff and a stable hover."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "执行航带（颜色与地图航线一致，点选后立即更新任务）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Flight lines to execute (colors match the map; tapping updates the task immediately)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "操作统一放在底部：预演 / 安全预检 / 执行。Simulator 激活时执行仿真；否则要求真机手动起飞并稳定悬停。人工介入会自动暂停、归零、释放控制并保存断点。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use the bottom controls for Preview / Safety Check / Execute. When Simulator is active, execution is simulated; otherwise manually take off and hold a stable hover. Manual intervention pauses automatically, zeros commands, releases control, and saves a checkpoint."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本段剩余 %@ · 全部剩余 %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Current segment %1$@ remaining · Total %2$@ remaining"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "本段剩余 %1$@ · 全部剩余 %2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "机头沿航迹（不倒飞）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Heading follows track (no reverse flight)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "模型原始 stop 分数 ≥ %@ 时立即悬停；修改会安全退出当前 VLN 控制。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hover immediately when the model's raw stop score is ≥ %@. Changing this safely exits current VLN control."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "模型始终预测 H10；开启后按所选 H1–H10 前缀执行，首个 stop 命中行只作停止哨兵、不执行移动。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The model always predicts H10. When enabled, execute the selected H1–H10 prefix; the first row meeting the stop condition is a stop sentinel and is not executed as motion."
          }
        }
      }
    },
